          "section": "3.1. The effect of the misfit",
          "quote": "Therefore, a part of the Cr and Co atoms with smaller atomic radii which is originally in the matrix phase will diffuse from inclusion II to inclusion I. Meanwhile, the elements Al and Ta with larger atomic radii originally in the precipitate phase will diffuse to the regions with bigger lattice parameters.",
